14e33b07b72f2173a383573cde3cbca12/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776324135","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1278420/71d6b4614e33b07b72f2173a383573cde3cbca12/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776324135","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Violence: Features large-scale medieval battles with depictions of physical violence, including armed combat with swords, axes, and bows, and soldiers being killed in action.\r\n\r\nAlcohol Use: Includes story descriptions and video sequences showing the consumption of alcohol."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is BLOCKLORDS?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BLOCKLORDS is a player-driven MMO medieval grand strategy game where your decisions and skills shape the world and narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from several playstyles, including farming, fighting, resource management, and ruling, and forge your own destiny as your Hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the pinnacle of strategy gaming with BLOCKLORDS and let your legacy be written in the annals of its world. Join us, as this medieval saga beckons you to make your mark. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1278420/extras/814bae03204b453ab183a39290f9f126.poster.avif?t=1776324135\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1278420/extras/814bae03204b453ab183a39290f9f126.webm?t=1776324135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1278420/extras