1278420/extras/10c2913c00030195e65054dbd4e9c16a.poster.avif?t=1776324135\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1278420/extras/10c2913c00030195e65054dbd4e9c16a.webm?t=1776324135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1278420/extras/10c2913c00030195e65054dbd4e9c16a.mp4?t=1776324135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Responsibility of Ruling:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oversee vast regions, implementing decisions on levies and spearheading the development of flourishing cities. Claim regions, harvest taxes, and shape your city's fate. Hire knights to defend your territories and remain vigilant over factors like population, order, and prosperity which will dictate the gameplay experience, all while becoming an influential leader. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Quest for Conquest:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dictate the destinies of entire kingdoms with a blend of power and strategy at your helm. As you claim the crown, take steps to cement a legacy that stands the test of time, with the command of mighty armies at your fingertips, venture forth to expand your dominions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1278420/extras/6087ec2a7a6b27a4cc2c492e1361fbbe.poster.avif?t=1776324135\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1278420/extras/6087ec2a7a6b27a4cc2c492e1361fbbe.webm?t=1776324135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1278420/extras/6087ec2a7a6b27a4cc2c492e1361fbbe.mp4?t=1776324135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","develo